---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — Photo Print Tool"
  description="Terms and conditions for using Photo Print Tool. Free, browser-based photo arrangement tool with no warranties or guarantees."
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="header-brand">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" width="28" height="28"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2" stroke="#F5AE0A" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="3.4" stroke="#F5AE0A" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M8 7l1.2-2.5h5.6L16 7" stroke="#F5AE0A" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
        <span>Photo Print Tool</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="header-actions">
        <a href="/" class="header-btn">Tool</a>
        <a href="/about" class="header-btn">About</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="header-btn">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-inner">
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: August 3, 2026</p>

      <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using Photo Print Tool, you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the tool.</p>

      <h2>Description of Service</h2>
      <p>Photo Print Tool is a free, browser-based application that arranges photos on A4 pages for printing or PDF export. All processing happens locally in your browser — no data is uploaded to any server.</p>

      <h2>Use at Your Own Risk</h2>
      <p>This tool is provided "as is" without any warranties, express or implied. We do not guarantee that the tool will be error-free, uninterrupted, or that the output will be suitable for any particular purpose.</p>

      <h2>User Responsibility</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for ensuring your photos and prints meet your requirements. We are not liable for any costs associated with printing, including wasted paper, ink, or other supplies.</p>

      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>You retain full ownership of any photos you upload. We claim no rights over your content.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>In no event shall we be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the tool.</p>

      <h2>Modifications</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify or discontinue the tool at any time without notice.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about these terms, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <nav class="footer-links">
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <p>Photo Print Tool — Free, private, browser-based. No uploads, no accounts.</p>
      <p class="footer-sub">Built with Astro. All processing happens locally in your browser.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
